import{_ as t,o as n,c as i,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 370 | Dou Continent · Setting Self-Consistency Assessment: Quantifying Low Self-Consistency","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 370 | Dou Continent · Setting Self-Consistency Assessment: Quantifying Low Self-Consistency","no":370,"module":2,"tags":["Dou Continent","Setting Self-Consistency","Quantified","Low Self-Consistency","Scoring"],"related":["97-Setting-Contradiction Self-Check Table","29-Symbiosis-Degree Assessment System","65-Energy Standardization and Measurement"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0370_模块2-斗罗-设定自洽度评估-低自洽度的量化.md","filePath":"en/0370_模块2-斗罗-设定自洽度评估-低自洽度的量化.md"}'),s={name:"en/0370_模块2-斗罗-设定自洽度评估-低自洽度的量化.md"};function a(r,e,l,c,d,h){return n(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-370-dou-continent-·-setting-self-consistency-assessment-quantifying-low-self-consistency" tabindex="-1">Entry 370 | Dou Continent · Setting Self-Consistency Assessment: Quantifying Low Self-Consistency <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-370-dou-continent-·-setting-self-consistency-assessment-quantifying-low-self-consistency" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 370 | Dou Continent · Setting Self-Consistency Assessment: Quantifying Low Self-Consistency&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Dou Continent System Decomposition (Entry 11) | Benchmark base: Documents 97, 29, 65</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-turning-something-s-off-into-a-score" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Turning &quot;something&#39;s off&quot; into a score <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-turning-something-s-off-into-a-score" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Turning &quot;something&#39;s off&quot; into a score&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Setting self-consistency is Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s hard metric for benchmarking any IP. It does not ask &quot;is it good to read,&quot; only &quot;does early and late match up.&quot; Dou Continent&#39;s problem is not some single hole, but holes forming a net. This entry, taking the law-first axiom as core, uses the setting-contradiction self-check table&#39;s caliber to quantify Dou&#39;s low self-consistency into a scoreable table. Protagonist uniqueness dependency: <strong>high (gift-style leaning oligarchic)</strong>. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s judging base has been upgraded to the six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Self-consistency cost spillover</strong>: to maintain surface self-consistency, the author needs many explanatory patches, which themselves create new contradictions</li><li><strong>Reader compensatory work</strong>: readers are forced to make up &quot;why this time is okay&quot; themselves; cognitive burden shifted to the audience</li><li><strong>Setting entropy growth</strong>: setting written more and more; contradictions grow exponentially; self-consistency maintenance cost out of control</li></ul><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Rule vagueness is power</strong>: when self-consistency is low, whoever holds final interpretation holds truth — and interpretation is in Tang San and the Divine Realm</li><li><strong>Myriad Ranks cannot expect</strong>: rules change often; Myriad Ranks cannot plan by them; civilization falls into uncertainty</li><li><strong>Knowledge cannot sediment</strong>: experience voided by setting changes; civilization knowledge base long reset to zero</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Interpretation monopoly</strong>: low self-consistency instead reinforces the protagonist&#39;s monopoly — the more contradictions, the more an &quot;authority&quot; is needed to announce truth</li><li><strong>Beneficiary of contradictions</strong>: setting vagueness lets Tang San always benefit from &quot;the rules are actually like this&quot;</li><li><strong>Others have no place to argue</strong>: supporting roles who question rules are negated by plot; only the protagonist&#39;s version counts</li></ul><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dou Low Self-Consistency</th><th>Anchor Symbiosis Alternative</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Early-late contradictions form a net</td><td>Setting-contradiction self-check table; entry-by-entry filing, periodic audit</td></tr><tr><td>Interpretation belongs to protagonist</td><td>Symbiotic Court + Anchor Council; interpretation public</td></tr><tr><td>Patches on patches</td><td>Law precedes; new content appendix incremental join</td></tr><tr><td>Reader compensatory work</td><td>Glossary unifies caliber; ambiguity forbidden</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The alternative&#39;s crux: self-consistency relies not on author conscience, but on institutional self-check.</p><p>Low self-consistency must be leveled by institutional self-check. Path D · human-engineered Dao-Law soul rings&#39; every rule is legislated first then written; Lin Hao-path growth can be uniformly caliber&#39;d by the glossary throughout; there is no &quot;this once is an exception.&quot; Transplanting this practice to Dou, early iron laws no longer get layer-by-layer padded by hundred-thousand-year rings, spirit souls, Extreme Douluo; the ~25-point self-consistency has a chance to return above the passing line.</p><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: enter Dou contradiction points one by one into the self-check table</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: Group A no audit; Group B periodic contradiction audit</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: self-consistency decay rate over chapters</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: output &quot;Dou Setting Self-Consistency Scorecard&quot;</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment-this-entry-s-core" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment (This Entry&#39;s Core) <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment-this-entry-s-core" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment (This Entry&#39;s Core)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Quantified score (out of 100):</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>Score</th><th>Notes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Realm numerical consistency</td><td>25/100</td><td>Late twenty-layer overall inflation</td></tr><tr><td>Soul-ring rule consistency</td><td>30/100</td><td>Hunting iron law overturned by spirit-soul patches</td></tr><tr><td>Strength-comparison consistency</td><td>20/100</td><td>Rank-leaping counter-kills frequent</td></tr><tr><td>Divine-Realm setting consistency</td><td>25/100</td><td>Rewritten repeatedly across multi-parts</td></tr><tr><td>Composite self-consistency</td><td><strong>~25/100 (low)</strong></td><td>Retcon-ending risk extreme</td></tr></tbody></table><p>A self-consistency of 25 does not say Dou is worthless, but says its setting credit has been overdrawn to a dangerous line. Readers no longer believe &quot;next time it will follow rules,&quot; and instead self-explain via &quot;protagonist halo.&quot; When a worldview needs readers to lie on its behalf, it has already lost its qualification as a world.</p><p>Low self-consistency also backfires on the worldview&#39;s solemnity. When readers discover rules can be overturned by plot, they no longer take any setting of the world seriously — divine positions no longer sacred, realms no longer serious, everything is only &quot;the picture the author wants you to see.&quot; Once a worldview loses seriousness, the values and thought it carries lose weight with it. Self-consistency is the bottom line of a worldview&#39;s dignity.</p><p>Setting self-consistency also concerns a world&#39;s &quot;livability.&quot; If readers are to seriously step into a world, they must believe its rules are stable and predictable. Dou&#39;s rules are sometimes loose, sometimes tight; readers cannot truly move in — they know &quot;rules loosen when the protagonist is in trouble,&quot; so they always stand outside the play as spectators. A low-self-consistency worldview is a world that lets readers only ever be tourists, never residents. Heng Yuan Zhou pursues high self-consistency precisely so its world can be truly lived in.</p><p>Supplementary verdict: self-consistency is not showing off, but a worldview&#39;s load-bearing wall. Low self-consistency means three things: readers cannot truly move in, setting cannot seriously carry values, new readers cannot easily trust. Heng Yuan Zhou, via the setting-contradiction self-check table, periodically audits and leaves every change on a traceable account. For ~25 self-consistency to recover, start by stopping &quot;this once is an exception.&quot;</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: self-consistency maintenance cost out of control</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: interpretation monopoly is the contradiction-beneficiary&#39;s privilege</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo self-consistency medium-high; Dou only ~25 points; gap vast</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: rule vagueness first strips Myriad Ranks of predictability</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: low-self-consistency worldview cannot be exported to multiversal civilization</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>25 points is Dou&#39;s self-consistency. Heng Yuan Zhou is not being harsh, but points out: for long-form writing to go far, self-consistency must first pass. Dou proves with three sequels that patches cannot patch up structural cracks.</p><p>In the final analysis, Dou Continent · setting self-consistency assessment · quantifying low self-consistency described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./368_模块2-斗罗-吃书烂尾深度分析-后期设定推翻前期.html">Entry 368 · Retcon-Ending Deep Analysis</a> · <a href="./386_模块2-斗罗-法则优先对照-衡元宙如何避免吃书烂尾.html">Entry 386 · Law-First Comparison</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/97-设定矛盾自查表.html">97-Setting-Contradiction Self-Check Table</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',31)])])}const y=t(s,[["render",a]]);export{g as __pageData,y as default};
